OL,3,APolice chief names two 'brave' officers
OL,4,Aamong seven people killed in crash near
OL,5,AMiddlesbrough
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo officers killed in a car crash near
OL,8,FMiddlesbrough this morning, which also
OL,9,Fkilled five others, have been named by
OL,10,FCleveland Police
OL,12,FChief Constable Victoria Fuller says PC
OL,13,FMatthew Blades and PC Tom Clough "were
OL,14,Fbrave officers protecting our
OL,15,Fcommunities"
OL,17,FThe occupants of the other vehicle were
OL,18,Fall males in their late teens, the BBC
OL,19,Funderstands
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
