OL,3,APolice chief names two 'brave' officers
OL,4,Aamong seven people killed in crash near
OL,5,AMiddlesbrough
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe collision happened on the A66 in
OL,8,FSouth Bank, near Middlesbrough on
OL,9,FTeesside, shortly after 03:30 BST on
OL,10,FSaturday when a car travelling the
OL,11,Fwrong way collided with a marked police
OL,12,Fvehicle
OL,14,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham says he is
OL,15,F"devastated" to hear about the crash,
OL,16,Fand thanks emergency services
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
